# Real secrets live only in .env, which must never be committed. Unlike the
# n8n encryption key in docker-compose.yml (a local dev-only fallback), the
# variables in this project's .env are live third-party API keys tied to the
# user's real accounts (NewsAPI, Groq, Airtable, Slack, SMTP) — they must
# never enter git history, even as a "placeholder that gets swapped later".
.env
